{"id":"word:hebrew:H1530","type":"word","title":"גַּל","subtitle":"H1530 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"something rolled , i.e. a heap of stone or dung (plural ruins ), by analogy, a spring of water (plural waves )","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to גַּל (H1530) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 34 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"גַּל (gal) means something rolled , i.e. a heap of stone or dung (plural ruins ), by analogy, a spring of water (plural waves ) First listed occurrence: 2Kgs 19 25."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"גַּל","transliteration":"gal","pronunciation":"gal","strong":"H1530","lemmaId":"hebrew:H1530","partOfSpeech":"n-m","forms":["גַּל","הַ/גַּ֣ל","גַּלִּ֥ים","לְ/גַלָּֽי/ו","גָ֑ל"],"morphs":[["HTd/Ncmsa",6],["HNcmpc/Sp3ms",6],["HR/Ncmpa",4],["HNcmpa",3],["HNcmsc",3],["HNcmsa",3],["HNcmpc/Sp3mp",3],["HC/Ncmpc/Sp2ms",2],["HR/Ncmpc/Sp3ms",1],["HRd/Ncmsa",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"something rolled , i.e. a heap of stone or dung (plural ruins ), by analogy, a spring of water (plural waves )","usage":"billow, heap, spring, wave.","full":"H1530. gal גַּל noun masculine Gen 31:48 heap, wave, billow (as rolled together, rolling, rolling up ), also spring , ᵑ0 Song 4:12 compare 3 below — absolute גַּל Job 8:17 5 t. (including הַגַּל Gen 31:48 +); גָּ֑ל 31:46 ; הַגָּ֑ל 31:46 ; לַגָּ֑ל Isa 25:2 ; construct גַּלֿ Josh 7:26 + 2t. + Gen 31:47-48 , q.see below; plural גַּלִּים 2Kin 19:25 6 t.; construct גַּלֵּיֿ Isa 48:18 ; suffix גַּלָּיו Psa 89:10 6 t.; גַּלֵּיהֶם 65:8 2 t.; — 1 heap of stones, a. ׳ג אבנים raised ( הקים ) over dead body Josh 7:26 ; 8:29 ; compare 2Sam 18:17 (with הִצִּיב ). b. גַּל alone Job 8:17 (roots wrapped about it). c. heap or pile made ( עשׂה ) for use in ratifying compact of Jacob with Laban Gen 31:46 (twice in verse); 31:48 ; 31:51 ; Genesis 38:52; 31:52 (twice in verse) compare also גַּלְעֵד proper name, dual heap of ruins Isa 25:2 ; elsewhere plural Hosea 12:12 ; 2Kin 19:25 = Isa 37:26 ; Job 15:28 Jer 9:10 ; 51:37 . 2 waves (rollers) in poetry, only plural, waves of sea Jer 5:22 ; 31:35 ; Isa 51:15 ; Job 38:11 ; Psa 65:8 ; 89:10 ; 107:25 ; 107:29 ; compare also in simile Ezek 26:3 ; Isa 48:18 ( גַּלֵּיהַֿיָּם ); figurative of chastisements from ׳י Psa 42:8 (|| מִשְׁבָּרִים ) Jonah 2:3 (|| id.); of army of Babylon's conqueror Jer 51:42 , 55 ; compare Zech 10:11 (VB; but Bev JPh xviii. 88 proposes גִּבְלִים compare Ezek 27:9 ). 3 spring , Song 4:12 חָתוּם מַעְיָן נָעוּל גַּל כַּלָּ֑ה אֲחוֺתִי נָעוּל גַּן a garden barred (is) my sister, bride, a spring barred, a fountain sealed ; but גַּן for ᵑ9 ᵑ6 ᵐ5 גַּל .","rootNote":"from 1556 ;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"2Kgs 19 25","keyReferences":["2Kgs 19 25","2Sam 18 17","Ezek 26 3","Gen 31 46","Gen 31 46","Gen 31 48","Gen 31 51","Gen 31 52"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":34,"occurrences":[{"reference":"2Kgs 19 25","book":"2Kgs","chapter":19,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"גַּלִּ֥ים","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmpa"},{"reference":"2Sam 18 17","book":"2Sam","chapter":18,"verse":17,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"גַּל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsc"},{"reference":"Ezek 26 3","book":"Ezek","chapter":26,"verse":3,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"לְ/גַלָּֽי/ו","source":"hebrew","morph":"HR/Ncmpc/Sp3ms"},{"reference":"Gen 31 46","book":"Gen","chapter":31,"verse":46,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"גָ֑ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNcmsa"},{"reference":"Gen 31 46","book":"Gen","chapter":31,"verse":46,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/גָּֽל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Gen 31 48","book":"Gen","chapter":31,"verse":48,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"הַ/גַּ֨ל","source":"hebrew","morph":"HTd/Ncmsa"},{"reference":"Gen 31 51","book":"Gen","chapter":